  "title": "Toyota to participate in the \"1000 Miglia Gran Turismo Experience 2026,\" a special program of the historic Italian rally, the 1000 Miglia",
  "summary": "Toyota Motor Corporation (Toyota) will participate in the 1000 Miglia Gran Turismo Experience 2026 (Miglia Gran Turismo), a special program for the 1000 Miglia 2026 to be held in Brescia, Italy, over five days from June 9 to 13, 2026 (Japan time). This marks the first time that a Japanese manufacturer has entered vehicles in a 1000 Miglia-related event.",
